gTE(){return"For each stock you've sold (fully or partially), shows what would have happened if you had kept holding those shares until today.\n\nCompares your actual sell price against the current price \u2014 so you can see your biggest regrets and your best exits.\n\nPartial exits show analysis for the shares already sold, independent of the remaining open position."},
