aHw(a){return"Gain or loss across all open positions, in "+a+".\n\nTotal P/L = Current Value \u2212 what your open positions have net cost you\n\nThat is Total Invested, except for a position that has already returned more than it cost: Total Invested shows 0 for it, but its surplus still counts here. Measured against what each trade cost in "+a+" on its own date where a dated rate exists, so it includes exchange-rate moves on foreign holdings (shown separately below when they matter). Where none exists, a sell uses the average rate of the holding's buys; anything else uses today's rate, and a note on this card says so. Includes gains already locked in by partial sells. Dividends are not part of this figure \u2014 their total is under Analysis \u2192 Overview \u2192 Portfolio Quality (Total Dividends Received), and each holding's own on its detail page."},
